ustom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-09T23:28:24-08:00","id":400071,"title":"","content":"Another great letter, Techpriest. I'm glad fate smiled upon Cobolt. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-10T17:18:25-08:00","id":401055,"title":"","content":"Glad to see Cobalt survived Techpriest, I'll be starting my letter tomorrow and should be up sometime then","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T13:05:58-08:00","id":402303,"title":"","content":"Excellent letter Techpriest.<br /> <br /> I can't decide if Cobalt's very lucky or very unlucky.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T15:27:43-08:00","id":402548,"title":"","content":"Okay, finally I have my letter up! Apologies if it seems a bit rushed, but today's been busier than I intended","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T15:46:18-08:00","id":402573,"title":"","content":"The letter did not seem rushed to me. I really liked it and am eager to see what comes next. Great job, Warrior Angel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T16:50:18-08:00","id":402606,"title":"","content":"Thanks guys. With future letters I'll be sure to write more directly to the various characters and try to connect things more. No sense joining a game just to write a solitary story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T12:05:02-08:00","id":403576,"title":"","content":"Good letter Warrior Angel.<br /> <br /> The Morrigan's next letter is now up, hope everyone enjoys it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4926,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","user":"Cod of Justice","date":". 02-12-2015, 05:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T13:47:01-08:00","id":403651,"title":"","content":"Nice letters! I will get to work on my own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T15:34:01-08:00","id":403759,"title":"","content":"Great letter, Cod of Justice. Very much looking forward to Exhalion's letter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-12T22:55:49-08:00","id":404155,"title":"","content":"Okay, letter posted. Sorry if it is a little short or doesn't fit in to what everyone is doing very well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-13T07:19:23-08:00","id":404451,"title":"","content":"I very much liked the letter, Exthalion. While I can only speak for myself, I thought it fit in nicely with what is going on. I plan to post on Sunday, hopefully giving angryicecream a chance to post. In any event, Techpriest should feel free to post on Monday or after I post, whichever comes first. Also always feel to either PM me or ask here if you have any questions. I'm always happy to give suggestions, but I don't want to ruin what I see as most fun in this type of game: creative control of your city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":790,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","user":"Cire","date":".  missed words 02-13-2015, 10:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-14T03:41:59-08:00","id":405660,"title":"","content":"I found your letter quite interesting Exthalion. Plus it gave me an idea for how to keep The Morrigan invested in the on going plot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T10:40:02-08:00","id":406823,"title":"","content":"I have run into more work than I expected this week-end so I will not be writing a letter from Blaze, but will try to use the &quot;missed&quot; letter to add drama for next time. 