eryone feel about having vampires ect show up? Mainly for the purpose of giving The Morrigan a greater variety of things to stab and be stabbed by.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was already hinting at mummies so go ahead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T01:43:21-08:00","id":408691,"title":"","content":"Outstanding letter, Techpriest!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T15:12:43-08:00","id":409361,"title":"","content":"Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-17T17:31:08-08:00","id":409428,"title":"","content":"Excellent letters from both of you, Techpriest and Warrior Angel.<br /> <br /> I'm working in my next letter and I'm afraid it's going to be ridiculously long. I made a mistake in leaving Conand unconscious at the end of my last letter because it means things I could have fitted in last week have ended up at the front of this on