-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Barring a group uprising, I think both regular ana Arcane experience can be used to buy new dots in arcana.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cool, will have to see what Phoenix shall be getting with all of this experience now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T10:48:04-08:00","id":427834,"title":"","content":"I'll go ahead and post mine. Probably be up some time tonight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T14:34:58-08:00","id":428134,"title":"","content":"Letter up. I'd also like to buy the second dots of the Destiny and Oathbound merits.<br /> <br /> The Morrigan's oath is an Oath of Allegiance, with 1 point of binding strength, 1 point of cost for swearing to die as a last resort and 0 points of cost for being sworn to a specific individual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Da