-03-10T15:40:40-07:00","id":436356,"title":"","content":"Hope you get better soon Techpriest. In the meantime, I'll do my next letter sometime tomorrow - a bit late here in the UK lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T09:36:23-07:00","id":438558,"title":"","content":"Hiya guys, managed to put my letter up now. Looking forward to seeing what happens next with the Morrigan and Ariadnos <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T13:48:13-07:00","id":438874,"title":"","content":"My letter's up now, I couldn't really think of much to have happen so I decided to post it now rather than drag it out while I tried to come up with more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T14:56:24-07:00","id":441864,"title":"","content":"Wow, this has been an awful sickness. I actually had to go to the ER. I'm feeling better than I was, but still recovering. I'll try to get something up by Monday. If not up by then go on ahead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T16:25:56-07:00","id":441948,"title":"","content":"First, Techpriest, I hope it goes without saying that getting better is job one. Second, get better! Third, I think I will have Blaze skip a week to give Exthalion any time again. Again, Techpriest, I hope you feel better soon!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T05:10:43-07:00","id":442428,"title":"","content":"Another great round! Great letter, Exthalion. Four experience points of regular and two of arcana experience for Warrior Angel, Cod of Justice, and Exthalion. I must go to work now, but I am not sure for how long. If there is time, I will write a blaze letter. However, Techpriest need not wait on me. Blaze can always wait. I am very much enjoying this game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T13:16:56-07:00","id":444820,"title":"","content":"I'm going to bow out for now guys. Getting sick really threw me off my game, and I want to save what concentration I have right now for the game I'm running. If I ever feel like I'm back at full capacity, I'll try to catch up and create some meaningful story for why Cobalt has been out of contact. Until then, good luck with the game guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4803-techpriest","name":"Techpriest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T13:59:51-07:00","id":444864,"title":"","content":"Techpriest, I totally understand, although I obviously will certainly miss you in this game. You are a great player. I cannot say strongly enough that you are welcome back any time whatsoever. As a very interested reader of your game, I wish you the very best with it. More important than all this, be well!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T11:19:01-07:00","id":446217,"title":"","content":"Sorry to hear Techpriest, but good luck with your game and hopefully see more of Cobalt in the future. In the meantime, I've better get writing!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T14:33:14-07:00","id":448284,"title":"","content":"My letter's up, kind of got lost on what I was doing with these Seers all of a sudden so they're the weakest part of my letter I'm afraid. As for spending experience, I think I have 13 normal experience &amp; 12 Arcane experience at the moment. So if it's okay Cire, I'll spend 21 points on getting Mind to level 3, and 4 points to buy Mental Shield as a rote for him as well using up all my experience so far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T18:19:14-07:00","id":448579,"title":"","content":"Fine by me. Good letter by the way!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T14:15:15-07:00","id":449763,"title":"","content":"Sorry to see you go, Techpriest.<br /> <br /> My letter's up now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T16:24:03-07:00","id":449884,"title":"","content":"Just wanted to say, liking the Free Council Crazy Archaeomancy Club <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And is that what the Chrysalides believe as part of the legacy? Just came across their name on an Mage index which said &quot;exemplars of perfection &amp; decrepitude in one&quot;, and thought the name sounded interesting enough to use lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T17:53:14-07:00","id":449949,"title":"","content":"I can't remember the full details of the beliefs but the but the attainments are all about creating an Ideal self, which is prettier and physically and mentally superior to the normal self, and I think the Ideal can look very different form the normal self. The catch is that the normal self is known as the Husk and has penalties where the Ideal has bonuses, and if you run out of Willpower you revert from the Ideal to the Husk.<br /> <br /> It's a very Seer legacy in it's thinking, especially in regards to appearance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T11:46:27-07:00","id":451836,"title":"","content":"Sounds like an interesting legacy, despite belonging to the Seers lol. Reminds me a bit of the Pure Sovereigns in the Silver Ladder book, but swings both ways while the Sovereigns just feel they are the best","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T11:59:04-07:00","id":451851,"title":"","content":"Sorry to constantly be late, will have my letter up tonight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T13:33:16-07:00","id":451982,"title":"","content":"Not at all, Exthalion. I sort of consider Saturday / Sunday your time zone. Also great letter, Cod of Justice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":