s":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T14:11:18-07:00","id":481584,"title":"","content":"Hi guys, just put my letter up now. Sorry to hear that Cire, especially to have that many quit in one go! But don't worry, just do what you can - real life is the most important (well, apart from the fate of the world our characters are currently facing!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T18:53:56-07:00","id":481815,"title":"","content":"Thank you. I shall try my best. Luckily, we have great players!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T15:57:22-07:00","id":484927,"title":"","content":"Still beset by work (am there still now), but wanted to say (write ?) good letter, Cod of Justice. As soon as possible, I will work out the experience owed. I deeply regret the extremeness of my work situation. I hope it is fixed soon. On the plus sis, I suppose I can get more Mage books soon. Honestly, thank you for your patience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T02:35:28-07:00","id":490356,"title":"","content":"Sorry for me being late with my letter this week everyone, this week turned out to be more busier than I thought. But I'm free this afternoon so it will be going up today","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-30T15:42:01-07:00","id":497940,"title":"","content":"Hi guys,<br /> Just posted my letter up now, and was wondering how everyone was. I know you're busy with work Cire, but is Exthalion no longer with us as we haven't heard from you for a while","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T08:06:58-07:00","id":498875,"title":"","content":"Hello. I am indeed sorry about work. We are starting to train in new people, but any event I need to figure out a way to work around always being at work. I'm very sorry I haven't proved up this yet. As to Exthalion, I too wonder. I hope that he is as I very much like his letters. Also I will try to figure out experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T13:34:46-07:00","id":500737,"title":"","content":"My letter might be a little late this week, I'm away so I'm typing on my tablet and it takes much longer than normal typing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-05T02:25:00-07:00","id":504003,"title":"","content":"Sorry, going to have to skip, my tablet just doesn't work for typing anything long and I won't have access to a computer till Friday night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T08:04:21-07:00","id":506795,"title":"","content":"Hi guys,<br /> Just posted up my letter, although sorry it hasn't advanced much as I haven't had much to go on. No worries though <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-07T12:05:01-07:00","id":507083,"title":"","content":"On a break at work, things are getting better. I will try to have experience by tomorrow. I am very sorry about all this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T12:28:09-07:00","id":509184,"title":"","content":"I'm back and my next letter is up","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T10:39:40-07:00","id":512118,"title":"","content":"Experience at long last. First, Warrior Angel. By my math, he has written 13 great letters, but has got gotten experience for only seven. This means that six are due for experiencing, meaning 24 regular experience, 12 Arcance experience. I will also add two free background dots as a reward for patience. Now, Cod of Justice. By may math, he has also written 13 great letters, but has only gotten experience for eight. This means that five are due for experience, meaning 20 regular experience, 10 Arcane experience. I will also add two free background dots as a reward for patience. I am actually current with Exthalion. However, I still think it only just to give him two free background dots as a reward for patience. I am also current with Techpriest, should we ever have the good fortune to have him as a player again.<br /> <br /> Again, thank you all for your patience. I &quot;showed my math&quot; so you may confirm I have not cheated any of you. While work has most certainly vexed me and thrawted much writing, I very much of enjoyed all your letters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T17:41:36-07:00","id":512409,"title":"","content":"Thanks for sticking with this Cire.<br /> <br /> The math looks good to me. By background dots to you mean merit dots?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T07:30:38-07:00","id":512900,"title":"","content":"First, thank you for sticking with it, Second, sorry. Yes, I meant merit dots. Thank you for clearing that up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-14T12:27:51-07:00","id":514387,"title":"","content":"Hi guys, just posted my letter up now and sorry for not being in touch sooner. I'm glad that all of us have stuck with this despite things cropping up in our lives, and have been enjoying it immensely <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Now I have to decide what to spend my experience on now!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-15T15:31:50-07:00","id":515508,"title":"","content":"New letter up. The Morrigan isn't particularly happy with what she's learnt this week and on a not unrelated note, Cire, can I spend 24 of my 26 Arcane xp to buy Gnosis 3?<br /> <br /> <br /> ps. Warrior Angel, she's not actually mad at Phoenix, he just managed to hit three of her buttons in one sentence while she was already in a bad mood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-15T20:54:06-07:00","id":515743,"title":"","content":"Totally fine with, Cod of Justice. Another great letter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-17T06:32:38-07:00","id":516984,"title":"","content":"Very nice letter Cod of Justice. Given what has happened to The Morrigan this week I can't say I blame her for being angry and lashing out in the slightest, and I'm sure that Phoenix won't take offence lol.<br /> <br /> I have the idea that Phoenix is used to other mages not sharing his beliefs - After all, when you can encounter spirits and other supernatural things that are powerful enough to be considered gods as well as consider what mages can actually do when they gain power, combine that with a place like the World of Darkness where a lot of bad things happen it will be very difficult for mages to believe in a higher power that supposed to watching over His children when things like soul-eating and Abyssal creatures are around. From what I've read as well, a lot of Mages no doubt see religion as another Lie for the Exarchs to control the masses. So I'd imagine Phoenix is in the minority of Mages' beliefs He's no bible-basher though, so when writing I try to show it through the odd line in his letters more than anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T09:53:21-07:00","id":521965,"title":"","content":"Okay, my letter's up. Still deciding on what to spend my experience on Cire, but will let you know when I decide lol. Hope The Morrigan feels better this week Cod of Justice :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T11:10:16-07:00","id":522043,"title":"","content":"So... um...<br /> <br /> Hi guys.<br /> <br /> I am really, really sorry for not posting or really explaining for all this time. Exams, work on my thesis, etc. took up my time. Which is no excuse for not giving better notice. I kept thinking I would get a break to write something, but it never really came together.<br /> <br /> If it is still okay, I would like to come back in and start posting. If my behavior has put anyone off I entirely understand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T20:11:51-07:00","id":522843,"title":"","content":"I would very much be thrilled to have you back! That would be great. Also great letter, Warrior Angel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":790,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","user":"Cire","date":".  Missing words 05-20-2015, 11:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T05:12:55-07:00","id":523101,"title":"","content":"Hi Exthalion, no worries these things happen. I for one have no problem with you coming back to the chronicle :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-21T09:12:56-07:00","id":523325,"title":"","content":"Hello. Most of the new batch of people we were trying to train in quit, but I do hope to have new Cire letter up by like Saturday, but more experience. As to an earlier discussion, Cire is very religious as was (will be ?) seen in past games. I feel mages have many diverse views. I like to think the world opened up to them opens up even more questions than even we have to deal with to understand the cosmos.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T11:40:48-07:00","id":524597,"title":"","content":"Be glad to have you back Exthalion.<br /> <br /> New letter up. The Morrigan's not quite back on form yet but Deirdre has a plan for that. Deirdre has several plans to fix that in fact and if you listen closely when reading this letter you might well hear the implications of those plans whooshing over The Morrigan's head (This week marks the point where Deirdre losses her patience with subtle hints and starts breaking increasingly large clue-bats over the Morrigan's head.)<br /> <br /> XP wise can I spend 2 points on Concilium Status 1, 12 points on Weaponry 4 and can I put both my free background dots into Hallow please?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T07:37:42-07:00","id":525454,"title":"","content":"Good letter, and yes to the spending and the dots allocation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T10:36:33-07:00","id":525584,"title":"","content":"I can have my letter out today. Is that appropriate for the rotation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T14:38:18-07:00","id":525961,"title":"","content":"I think so. I am very much looking forward to reading it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T14:42:58-07:00","id":528106,"title":"","content":"Some great letters there Exthalion, now I'm going to have to figure out a decent guess at what it could all mean for Phoenix!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T08:04:58-07:00","id":531018,"title":"","content":"My letter's just been posted. I'll be posting earlier in the week as well, thanks to work shifts changing around. So hopefully that gives everyone time to write up rather than cramming everyone's letters into the second half of the week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-28T08:28:15-07:00","id":531035,"title":"","content":"Good letters Warrior Angel and Exthalion. You will be hearing from Cire soon. I must work the next 24 or so hours, but then I will try to finish what I started, plus give out experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T16:34:19-07:00","id":532500,"title":"","content":"New letter up. I have to admit the greatest challenge I'm finding with this format is getting across things that I want to make clear but my pov character is oblivious to. Admittedly by this week the main one of those things is no longer remotely subtle but I kind of wish I'd been able to work the subtler hints in better/more clearly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-29T21:53:17-07:00","id":532761,"title":"","content":"That indeed is a challenge, Cod of Justice. In past games, people at times wrote prose in the OoC thread to address that very problem. It can also be elaborated on after the fact. In any case, great letter. <br /> <br /> My own letter is not coming as quick as I would like, but should be here soon. I also plan to get experience done around random bits of work as fate allows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T10:12:24-07:00","id":537178,"title":"","content":"Hi guys, just about to start writing my letter for the week and should be posted either later today or tomorrow. No problem Cire, looking forward to hearing about Cire's investigation and the possible fate of Blaze. But work does have to come first so when you get a chance.<br /> <br /> Cod, really liked your last letter. Assuming I'm getting the right impression about Deirdre starting to fancy The Morrigan, it was something I was tempted to mention a few weeks back about when you wrote about Deirdre's proximi curse although more from the possibility of The Morrigan falling for her than the other way around. Would you have any objection if Phoenix brings it up in his letter, and if not how would you prefer he bring it up? Right to the point - &quot;Morrigan, have you considered that Deirdre may be attracted to you?&quot; - or just hint at it - &quot;Morrigan, have you considered why Deirdre has been acting quite affectionate towards you?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T11:35:39-07:00","id":537240,"title":"","content":"You're pretty close, although it's a bit more complex than that makes it sound. The attraction has been there for a while but Deirdre's only felt confident enough in the situation to be more overt recently. Feel free to bring it up, direct is probably best since it would be a good excuse to state some semi-backstory, semi-current information that The Morrigan wouldn't mention otherwise.<br /> <br /> Cire, don't push yourself to get something written, whenever you have time is fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-02T13:10:11-07:00","id":537363,"title":"","content":"No problem, shall get started on carrying on with my letter and putting it in a direct and obvious way for Morrigan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T17:14:57-07:00","id":538956,"title":"","content":"New letter up.<br /> <br /> Spoiler alert, the Oneiros trip is not going to reveal what The Morrigan thinks it will. Deirdre's plan for the trip is basically to take The Morrigan through as many realms related to her feelings as it takes for the message to sink in, and <i>then</i> look for unusual features. Aengus' plan is to get some much needed laughs watching the first part and possibly start a Cabal betting pool on how many realms it takes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T13:58:24-07:00","id":544230,"title":"","content":"Great letters. Experience gain at long last. First, Warrior Angel. By my math, he has written 17 great letters, but has got gotten experience for only 13. This means that four are due for experiencing, meaning 16 regular experience, 8 Arcance experience. Now, Cod of Justice. By may math, he has also written 17 great letters, but has only gotten experience for 13. This means that four are due for experience, meaning 16 regular experience, 8 Arcane experience. Exthalion wrote a great letter (so to speak), meaning he gets four regular experience, two Arcane experience. Thank you again for your patience, and please alert me if I am error. I love this game. Now back to work. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T14:19:02-07:00","id":544258,"title":"","content":"Amazing letters everyone. Working on my next one in the hope that it will be something less of a placeholder. The previous ones were more or less unconnected, hinting at the cockamamie explanation I came up with for the absence. Now I am trying for something a little more definite.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T11:29:15-07:00","id":550427,"title":"","content":"Hi guys, work's been keeping me busier than I expected so I'll be starting this week's letter now and should have it up sometime this evening.<br /> <br /> Just checking Cire, as I haven't spent any of the experience from the last lot (really need to sort that out!) that should leave me at 40 regular experience &amp; 20 Arcane experience, as well as the two free background dots?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T15:26:39-07:00","id":550815,"title":"","content":"I think that is correct, Warrior Angel. Great letter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-11T15:43:48-07:00","id":550829,"title":"","content":"Thanks Cire :-) I'm going to try and make Phoenix's letters a bit less formal than they were, as my impression of his character is that his Silver Ladder training has gotten him used to being formal with mages he hasn't met before, hence why I've tried to make him write more formally when he writes. But as the others become more known to him he will relax his language a bit (and give me a bit of a break trying to sound formal all the time lol). In particular thanks to the weeks speaking to Morrigan, he will be more relaxed and talk to her more like he does with the other mages he knows.<br /> <br /> Also Cire I've decided on some of my xp spending if these are alright with you - I'll spend all my Arcane experience &amp; 4 of my regular experience to gain Gnosis 3 (24 points); 12 xp (2+4+6) on Allies 3 (Local Arrow); 7 xp on Fate 1 although Phoenix won't be able to use it for another two weeks for training, 2 xp on learning the Winds of Chance rote, 4 xp on Status 2 (Consilium) to represent his higher status gained throughout the story. Oh, and I'll spend the two background points on Hallow rising it to Hallow 3.<br /> <br /> Altogether that should leave me with 0 Arcane experience &amp; 11 regular experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T08:10:16-07:00","id":551509,"title":"","content":"That all sounds good to me. I am really enjoying the back and fort between Phoenix and Morrigan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T16:17:42-07:00","id":553503,"title":"","content":"Thanks Cire :-) And great letter as always Cod! Phoenix will of course be happy to hear what The Morrigan wants to say to him, and he will let her know in his next letter. I was a bit curious though, as I've noticed it in a number of letters you've written, why the word Bellerophon keeps appearing at time in grey/white? For example - &quot;for their locations at the time. <span style=\"color:#D3D3D3\">BellerophonBellerophon</span> The Daksha&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T16:34:39-07:00","id":553534,"title":"","content":"Exactly what's going on with that is something that will become clear over the course of forthcoming letters, a little bit in the next and then it'll be the major plotline in Belfast for a bit. Bellerophon is The Morrigan attempting to remind herself of something subconsciously - she's not actually aware she's written the word in any of her letters at the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T07:36:24-07:00","id":554277,"title":"","content":"Ah I see, looking forward to see how that develops. Is it something that you would like Phoenix or Ariadnos to mention in their letters, or allow The Morrigan to realise as it comes appropriate to her story?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T08:53:33-07:00","id":554353,"title":"","content":"Go ahead and mention it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T10:08:26-07:00","id":555827,"title":"","content":"If you're sure Cod, then I'll get Phoenix to mention it in this week's letter. Exthalion, Cire - Do either of you want to post a letter this week before I post mine tomorrow?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T12:19:26-07:00","id":557192,"title":"","content":"Thank you. I will try to get up a letter by tomorrow (within the next ten hours). If not, and absent input from Exthalion, please go ahead. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T13:18:26-07:00","id":557240,"title":"","content":"No problem Cire, I'll do mine tomorrow evening UK time if that gives you some extra time to post \ud83d\ude0a","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T14:04:57-07:00","id":557312,"title":"","content":"Thank you! I got mine up. You guys are amazing writers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T09:49:08-07:00","id":558374,"title":"","content":"Just posted mine now. Thanks Cire <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> So are you! Will be interesting to see who else has Blaze contacted and what Cire comes across in his investigation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-18T15:31:02-07:00","id":559854,"title":"","content":"New letter up. Can I spend 18 regular xp to get Mind 3 please Cire?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T11:34:50-07:00","id":560973,"title":"","content":"Great letter Cod, especially the first bit about the Mysterium members <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cod of Justice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/392094-the-twin-goblets-of-arratus-an-epistolary-mage-game-set-in-2009?p=559849#post559849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Oh brave and wise lady Arrow, please save us from the rampaging Atavism we have called up. We were sure we could master it despite the fact we are so weak and helpless as to be in danger of being mugged by passing kittens and the fact the closest we get to nature is when birds shit on us...</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4910,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","user":"warrior angel","date":".  Figuring out using the quote system properly! 06-19-2015, 02:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T13:26:38-07:00","id":561079,"title":"","content":"The Morrigan would like to be exasperatedly fond of the local Mystagogues but a significant portion of them are arrogant and short-sighted enough that she tends to be far more exasperated than fond.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T18:41:34-07:00","id":561462,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cod of Justice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/392070-ooc-the-twin-goblets-of-arratus-an-epistolary-mage-campaign-set-in-2009?p=559854#post559854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">New letter up. Can I spend 18 regular xp to get Mind 3 please Cire?</div> </div> </div> </div>Most certainly! Great letters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T13:28:44-07:00","id":568321,"title":"","content":"Sorry guys, I'll be running a bit late this week with my letter as work decided to change my shifts at the last minute. Will you all mind waiting until tomorrow evening for my letter?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T14:11:12-07:00","id":568375,"title":"","content":"No worries","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T20:28:23-07:00","id":568695,"title":"","content":"I too am sorry. My work got me again, plus my father encountered health trouble. I am trying to get my act together. In the very least, I'll try to get experience up soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":790,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","user":"Cire","date":".  More Stuff 06-25-2015, 11:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T16:54:20-07:00","id":569787,"title":"","content":"Letter's finally up, and thanks for your patience. Sorry to hear about your father Cire, for what it's worth I wish him well.<br /> <br /> Part of me isn't entirely happy with the last bit addressed to The Morrigan. I imagine for a Christian the subject of sin and redemption is a deep one, and I tried to put that across with Phoenix as he gave his opinion. But I'm not sure if I managed to put what I wanted across. It will have to do I supposed, hope it works anyway","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T20:08:26-07:00","id":569858,"title":"","content":"Thank you very much. He is on the mend. As to the last bit to Morrigan, I liked it. From a character point of view, he was clearly selecting his words with care and showing true concern. As you say, sin and redemption are a vast topic with any number of schools of thought. Yet he was making a point not teaching a class so I thought you handled it very well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-27T09:02:23-07:00","id":570279,"title":"","content":"New letter up. I think the last section in Phoenix's letter worked well, maybe not the most perfect way of saying it but none of the characters say things perfectly, especially about so weighty a subject.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-01T15:51:36-07:00","id":575726,"title":"","content":"Sorry guys, work's been keep me busy and has been insufferable thanks to this heatwave we have at the moment in the UK. New letter's up as well, and glad to hear that you both found the last section of last week's letter alright. Good to hear Cire about your father as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T12:41:56-07:00","id":577627,"title":"","content":"New letter up despite the best efforts of the heat and I finally managed to include some details about Dagda's Legacy and backstory, many months after I came up with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-07T20:50:06-07:00","id":583137,"title":"","content":"Great letters, and I hope everyone had a great July Fourth. Sorry that my work never seems to end. My mother is also my boss and my father's health issues caused her to go on a leave of absence to help take care of him, meaning her hours had to be filled along with so many others. Yet it is a good problem to contend with as it is a result of my father still being here. Even so, I feel I can and I shall start doing a better job here for this game.<br /> <br /> With that in mind, since I last gave experience, Warrior Angel wrote four great letters. Therefore, he has earned 16 regular experience, and 8 arcane experience. Cod of Justice has also written four great letters, and likewise earns 16 regular experience, and 8 arcane experience. Exthalion has written a great letter and earns 4 experience and 2 arcane experience.<br /> <br /> In other great news, Daimon has expressed interest in joining and that is great news. I look forward to hearing from him and am sure I will make our game even more interesting.<br /> <br /> Lastly, I am working on a Cire letter to explain what happened to him now. I am very much impressed with you guys. You are all such great writers. It is humbling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T15:25:52-07:00","id":583907,"title":"","content":"Hiya guys, just posted my letter now. Quite enjoyed The Morrigan's letter Cod, quite interested to see how your story works out. And don't worry Cire, family is important and we've been keeping things going in the meantime :-) And a new player then. If you read this Daimon then welcome to the game and look forward to meeting your character","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T21:10:33-07:00","id":584156,"title":"","content":"Thank you, Warrior Angel! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-10T16:08:22-07:00","id":586527,"title":"","content":"New letter up.<br /> <br /> I quite liked the style the last letter from Adrianos but the Morrigan would find it fairly opaque at the best of times, which she is assuredly not having at the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-11T04:51:06-07:00","id":586970,"title":"","content":"Hello. Thank you for warm welcome.<br /> <br /> Aaand here he is:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Shadow Name:</b> Yosef<br /> <b>Real Name:</b> Daniil Sosnovsky<br /> <b>Player:</b> Daimon<br /> <b>Chronicle:</b> the Twin Goblets of Arratus<br /> <b>City:</b> Novosibirsk, Russia, Asia<br /> <br /> <b>Path:</b> Moros<br /> <b>Order:</b> Guardians of the Veil<br /> <b>Legacy:</b> Votaries of the Ordained<br /> <br /> <b>Virtue:</b> Faith<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Wraith<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Repentant Mafia Boss<br /> <br /> <b>Advantages:</b><br /> Health: 7<br /> Willpower: 6<br /> Defence: 2<br /> Initiative: 6<br /> Speed: 9<br /> <br /> <b>Gnosis:</b> 3<br /> <b>Wisdom:</b> 5<br /> <b>Max Mana:</b> 12<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> Intelligence: 2<br /> Wits: 3<br /> Resolve: 3<br /> <br /> Strength: 2<br /> Dexterity: 2<br /> Stamina: 2<br /> <br /> Presence: 2<br /> Manipulation: 4<br /> Composure: 3<br /> <br /> <b>Skills</b><br /> Academics 1,<br /> Crafts 1,<br /> Investigation 3,<br /> Occult (Messiah) 1,<br /> Politics 1.<br /> <br /> Firearms 1,<br /> Larceny (organizing) 3,<br /> Stealth 1.<br /> <br /> Empathy 1,<br /> Intimidation 3,<br /> Persuasion 1,<br /> Streetwise (russian organized crime) 4,<br /> Subterfuge 2.<br /> <br /> <b>Merits</b><br /> Language (English, Fenya, native Russian)<br /> High Speech,<br /> Masque (Specter)<br /> Status (local crime 4, Guardians 2)<br /> Contacts (organized crime)<br /> Resources 4<br /> <br /> <b>Arcana:</b> Fate 4, Matter 2, Death 1, Space 1<br /> <br /> <b>Rotes:</b> Fate: 1 Quantum Flux, Sybil\u2019s Sight, 2 Swearing an Oath; Space: 1 Finder, Spatial Awareness<br /> <br /> <b>Nimbus</b><br /> Yosef's nimbus is a feel of security, as if everything is going to be all right.<br /> <br /> <b>Backstory</b><br /> <br /> Daniil\u2019s parents were librarian and minor bureaucrat. They were diligent, gentle and loyal to Party. All in all they were model citizens. Young Daniil\u2019s friends were nothing like that. Short-tempered and clever he led a band of young ruffians before he even got a beard. They were thieves, vandals and, as they matured, robbers. Once they accidentally killed a man they wanted to beat down and rob. While militsiya (police) didn\u2019t manage to prove gang\u2019s involvement, the resulting scrutiny allowed to solve some of the past crimes. And so, Daniil Sosnovsky met his 16th birthday in a jail.<br /> <br /> Some people in jail begin to contemplate their sins. Daniil instead saw an opportunity to make useful contacts. His cunning mind and strict following of thieves law earned him respect of other criminals. They nicknamed him Coffin (Sosnovsky means Pine\u2019s in Russian). Three years later he was once again free. It was 1991. Soviet Union dissolved. It was a time of Free Market. Many (probably most) of businessmen were criminals as well. And this was a time of great opportunity not only for white-collar crime. Daniil organized a new gang. He abandoned all shreds of innocence he had before. Counterfeit, extortion, murder. He skyrocketed through the ranks of Russian organized crime. Six years later, in the age of 25 he was \u2018crowned\u2019 as a Thief-in-Law (member of elite of Russian crime world).<br /> <br /> Normal citizen\u2019s would\u2019ve called Daniil and his actions evil. But among his peers and subordinates he was actually known not only for his ruthlessness and anger but also for being protective over his people and his territory (which by that time included most of the city). When family member of one of his thugs fell ill, he helped with money. When minor politician decided to close local church, Daniil responded with blackmail. When abomination from the Abyss decided to eat the city in 1999, Daniil wasn\u2019t ready.<br /> <br /> It was seemingly normal day. Daniil was driving his car to meet one of his \u2018business\u2019 partners. Suddenly he stopped to understand the map of local area. Streets were connected in the wrong way, a whole district was missing and his car was on the wrong side of the street. Daniil wasn\u2019t good enough with driving so the latter anomaly shortly caused car wreck.<br /> <br /> He opened his eyes on a colossal graveyard. The closest tombstones were dedicated to his dead friends, subordinates, and victims. Many of them he didn\u2019t even know, but shades that emerged from graves all silently looked at him. In the center of graveyard stood a lead tombstone without a name. Daniil understood that whatever he do, he will die anyway and will have to meet face to face with all sins he committed. Filled with sudden calm he accepted this fate and signed his name on the tombstone.<br /> <br /> Shortly after that he was found by magister of Guardians of the Veil who was busy fixing remains of the catastrophe. Almost half of local mages (Hierarch including) died trying to stop Abyssal intruder. So, urgently needing new blood they welcomed recently Awakened crime lord in their mids. But Daniil changed. He desperately wanted to somehow redeem his previous actions. Philosophy of Guardians fitted him perfectly. Daniil (or Yosef, as he became known among mages) remained a Thief-in-Law but often used his organization for various Guardian missions. Now, ten years later he is city\u2019s one of the most powerful and resourceful Guardian. And he is beginning to think that maybe, just maybe, he is getting closer to redemption.<br /> <br /> <b>Experience</b><br /> Unspent:<br /> Spent: 30<br /> <br /> -Additional Details-<br /> Age: 37<br /> Gender: Male<br /> Nationality: Russian<br /> Hair Color: Black, with a bit of gray<br /> Eye Color: Green<br /> Sexuality: Heterosexual<br /> Spirituality: Guardian cult of Hieromagus<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.bowlingbux.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/cool-clothes-for-men-in-their-40s.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Portrait</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I hope to post my first letter in a few days.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":120,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","user":"Daimon","date":".  added portrait 07-11-2015, 09:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-11T19:43:27-07:00","id":587646,"title":"","content":"On a quick break from work, giving me the chance to welcome Daimon! I should mention for any math fans that I gave Daimon a few experience so he is not quite as far behind but still a bit behind to respect the effort already put in, if that makes sense. I look forward to seeing what happens now. Good letter Cod of Justice!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-13T08:40:52-07:00","id":589248,"title":"","content":"Welcome Daimon, Yosef seems like quite the interesting character. Looking forward to seeing what happens with him and his interactions with Phoenix and the gang so far :-)<br /> <br /> As well so we have it sorted, what will be the new posting order? As at the moment it's something like me (Warrior Angel) -&gt; Cod of Justice -&gt; Exthalion with Cire being free to post at any time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-13T17:15:54-07:00","id":589661,"title":"","content":"Yeah, playing Yosef will be an interesting challenge, as I have absolutely no connection with criminals irl and almost everything I know about thiefs-in-law comes from Wikipedia. I hope that my attempt won't be that bad though.<br /> <br /> It'll be especially interesting since Phoenix is a student of Law and Morrigan was a government agent while Yosef had HUGE issues with laws and governments.<br /> <br /> Maybe I should wait for the end of the current &quot;turn&quot;? Than the posting order would be:<br /> Warrior Angel -&gt; Cod of Justice -&gt; Exthalion -&gt; Daimon<br /> <br /> My letter is <s>almost</s> ready, <s>I just need to be sure that Cire is not against some of my ideas</s> (done). So if <s>he will have some free time and</s> Exthalion won't mind, I can post earlier and the order would be:<br /> Warrior Angel -&gt; Cod of Justice -&gt; Daimon -&gt; Exthalion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":120,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","user":"Daimon","date":". 07-14-2015, 03:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T08:17:56-07:00","id":590228,"title":"","content":"Unless anyone else has any objections, I'm alright with that turn order. My letter should be posted later today, just popping out for a bit first and then I'll get my letter started.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T08:27:21-07:00","id":590233,"title":"","content":"Huh, I thought that Exthalion is next. If he is skipping his turn than maybe it's better for me to be next? I have my letter ready. What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T11:04:29-07:00","id":590307,"title":"","content":"Oh I see - We've sort of gone with the idea that each week the turn order started from the beginning which meant that if Exthalion for example didn't post his letter by the end of the previous week then I would post mine as it's the start of the new week. At least something like that typically happened. But if you have your letter ready Daimon then post by all means, then if Exthalion or Cire want to post then let us know otherwise I'll post mine tomorrow then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-14T11:31:56-07:00","id":590339,"title":"","content":"Ok, posted it.<br /> <br /> Letters were delivered by something like reversed Gift of Fortune spell. Obviously this method isn't that secure, so Yosef tried to write letters in a way that won't damage the Veil in case of intercepting. Next letters would be written in a usual way, so maybe I'll stop using code (it was fun but sometimes hard).<br /> <br /> In case you were wondering, the Fate enchantment on the letters bestow Winds of Chance (general blessing of luck, no dice bonuses) on anyone who is touching them. This spell will end with the new moon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T07:31:28-07:00","id":591284,"title":"","content":"A good letter Daimon, and certainly sounds like something a Guardian would write without saying anything discriminating about the Awakened. I'm just finishing off Phoenix's letter now, but I couldn't help but notice though, wouldn't Yosef need to have Space 2 to be able to use Gift of Fortune?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T08:32:14-07:00","id":591361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>warrior angel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/392070-ooc-the-twin-goblets-of-arratus-an-epistolary-mage-campaign-set-in-2009?p=591284#post591284\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I couldn't help but notice though, wouldn't Yosef need to have Space 2 to be able to use Gift of Fortune?</div> </div> </div> </div>It bothered me a bit too, but I decided that Space 2 is only needed to target the item (and Yosef had letters on hand so he didn't need the sympathetic component). If you don't agree with me than well, Yosef didn't specify the delivery method in letter. Maybe, he used help of some other mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T08:59:58-07:00","id":591384,"title":"","content":"I'm alright with it Daimon, just noticed it when I looked up the spell that's all <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Anyway, I've just posted my letter up. I figured that as Yosef has written out of the blue, that Phoenix wouldn't just casually write to him like he does with Morrigan &amp; co as he's gotten to know them a bit better over the past few months. Hence having the two letters to the same group. Hope that's not a problem","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-17T01:43:19-07:00","id":593634,"title":"","content":"New letter up. Welcome to the game Daimon. I felt that since Yosef was obviously attempting to be secretive in his communication and Phoenix had already replied to him the Morrigan would hold off on writing until she knew more about him.<br /> <br /> Admin wise, the Morrigan has now joined a Legacy, the Brotherhood of the Demon Wind form the Arrow Order book.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T21:27:50-07:00","id":595370,"title":"","content":"Once again, great letters and clever solutions to odd situations. I love it. Cod of Justice, the Legacy sounds good to me. Since I last gave experience, Warrior Angel wrote two great letters. Therefore, he has earned 8 regular experience, and 4 arcane experience. Cod of Justice has also written two great letters, and likewise earns 8 regular experience, and 4 arcane experience. Daimon has written a great letter and earns 4 experience and 2 arcane experience.<br /> <br /> I play to write another Cire letter very soon (in less than 30, depending on how long it takes me to write it after I return home from work about 24 hours from now). I fear I made a grave misstep in my last letter, but I plan to make it into a good way to advance the story. At least, that is the goal. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As always, thank you for your patience.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T12:25:31-07:00","id":597166,"title":"","content":"I'll have to start deciding what to spend all of this experience again lol. Some great letters there guys, and congratulations Cod of Justice for Morrigan becoming a Sister of the Demon Wind. If you're still planning on posting a letter Cire, then I'll wait to post mine until tomorrow so you have time. Also Exthalion, if you want to post a letter first then let me know and I'll be happy to wait a bit longer.<br /> <br /> I was thinking as well this week having Phoenix writing separately to Yosef and the rest of the group again. By doing this he can give the okay so-to-speak to the others as well as allow Yosef to know that his letters were received by the others, so next week everyone can write to everyone as usual then. Is that alright with everyone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-21T06:53:06-07:00","id":598271,"title":"","content":"Warrior Angel, I fear I am having some trouble figuring out to correct my misstep so feel free to post, at least in reference to me. As to writing two letters, that makes a lot of sense and Cire will do the same. If only this game were as well run as it is played. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-21T07:48:55-07:00","id":598350,"title":"","content":"The two letters plan sounds fine to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-22T09:11:58-07:00","id":599493,"title":"","content":"Okay, my letters are finally up! I'm also glad to be able to use some of the Changeling background I made up a while ago for Cardiff, although this is the first that I've had to worry about mages and the Hedge. From what I've gathered, the Prime 3 spell Armour of the Soul should be enough I think to mitigate the damage caused by the Hedge (or at least that's how I would run things) so a trip to the Hedge is in order for next week for Phoenix.<br /> <br /> I'm also want to spend some of my experience finally. After going back and double checking I should have 35 experience and 12 arcane experience to use (11 left over from last time, plus the last two rewards from Cire). If it's alright with you Cire I'm going to use the 12 arcane experience and 6 normal to improve Prime to 3, I'll save the rest as I have plans for some sort of Imbued item for him to have in the future, so that should leave me with 29 experience for me to decide what to do with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-23T12:40:14-07:00","id":600847,"title":"","content":"New letter up. I'm going to hold off on spending experience for now - The Morrigan is too busy to work in training time at the moment..<br /> <br /> Warrior Angel, I'm pretty sure you don't need to spend xp on Imbued items after character creation. In fact given that you can create them at Prime 3 I'm almost certain you don't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-24T15:16:03-07:00","id":602295,"title":"","content":"Good letter, Cod of Justice. Also I think you are right on imbued items. So I'm sending Warrior Angel a refund. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> All of you good work. Experience soon, after I return from work in a few days. Seems like I just got home. lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T11:28:07-07:00","id":605748,"title":"","content":"Sorry work about a day and half longer than planned. Since I last gave experience, Warrior Angel wrote a great letter. Therefore, he has earned 4 regular experience, and 2 arcane experience. Cod of Justice has also written a great letter, and likewise earns 4 regular experience, and 2 arcane experience. Daimon too has written a great letter and earns 4 experience and 2 arcane experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T16:12:23-07:00","id":606058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cod of Justice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/392070-ooc-the-twin-goblets-of-arratus-an-epistolary-mage-campaign-set-in-2009?p=600847#post600847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">New letter up. I'm going to hold off on spending experience for now - The Morrigan is too busy to work in training time at the moment..<br /> <br /> Warrior Angel, I'm pretty sure you don't need to spend xp on Imbued items after character creation. In fact given that you can create them at Prime 3 I'm almost certain you don't.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're right Cod, according to the rulebook I won't need to spend xp on Imbued items obtained during play. But will of course have Phoenix take the time to make any items properly. I'm also sorry to say I'll have to skip my turn this week, but I'll have Phoenix give a reason such as being injured during his adventures in the Hedge. Sorry guys","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T17:15:35-07:00","id":606096,"title":"","content":"Posted my letter. Better late than never. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T19:03:57-07:00","id":606199,"title":"","content":"I hope people feel that way when I get my letter up, Daimon. lol<br /> <br /> Also Warrior Angel, it will no doubt be worth the wait and I live in the ultimate glass house.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-31T12:11:41-07:00","id":609817,"title":"","content":"New letter up.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking about starting a plotline which would lead to the Morrigan picking up a new Artefact, and as a prelim to that I'm trying to design it, which leads to the following question; What dot level of Space is appropriate for a spell which allows you to apply your defence against ranged attacks? I'm thinking two but I'm not sure. Or possibly Time two. Opinions would be greatly appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-05T15:38:56-07:00","id":616857,"title":"","content":"Hi guys, sorry for my silence since my last post. Letter's finally posted and I'm glad I was able to use some of the things I had stored regarding the Hedge in it as well <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> Some great letters though from you both though!<br /> <br /> As for your question Cod, after having a look through the online index I use (if anyone here's interested, here it is: <a href=\"http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Complete+Mage+the+Awakening\" target=\"_blank\">wodindex.wikispaces.com/Complete+Mage+the+Awakening</a>) there seems to be a spell in the Adamantine Arrow book called Track Projectile that allows you to determine the path and origin of a projectile within sensory range during the duration of the spell. It's Space 2, with an optional Time 2 to see projectiles that occurred before the spell was cast. So perhaps a variation of this spell would allow you to determine the bullet's path before before it's shot, allowing you to apply your defence against ranged attacks? There's also a spell in Banishers apparently called Worst Moment, which sounds similar and is Time 2 with optional Space 2 but I'm not sure what it does exactly as I don't have the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T08:28:32-07:00","id":618930,"title":"","content":"Great, great letters. You three really put me to shame! All three of you are amazing writers. Like Cire, I plan to very carefully reread everything ASAP. As to Cod's question, I think Warrior Angel has it. When I am home, I'll see if I can find out more. Plus experience soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T13:14:19-07:00","id":619308,"title":"","content":"My letter will be a little bit late this week - work was busier today than every other day this week combined and I've got a family thing during the day tomorrow. Should be up by Sunday at the latest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-08T14:57:54-07:00","id":620571,"title":"","content":"New letter up. I'm still not totally happy with it, but given it consists largely of plot points that haven't been in previous letters because I couldn't think of a way to include them I was happy with that's probably to be expected.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the comments on the spell. Track projectile was what gave me the idea, so Space 2 seems to be about right. Worst moment is apparently to get the best opportunity to ambush someone, with Space to determine the best location, so not really what I'm looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T16:42:11-07:00","id":621682,"title":"","content":"Good letter Cod, and I don't see any problem with how you introduced the plot points in. Looking forward to Morrigan kicking more butt when it comes to dealing with the fallout of Conchobar's duel.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cod of Justice</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/392070-ooc-the-twin-goblets-of-arratus-an-epistolary-mage-campaign-set-in-2009?p=620571#post620571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Worst moment is apparently to get the best opportunity to ambush someone, with Space to determine the best location, so not really what I'm looking for.</div> </div> </div> </div>So that's what it does eh? My mistake then :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T06:47:16-07:00","id":625401,"title":"","content":"Sorry. I'm absolutely late and lack inspiration. I'm skipping this turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-14T13:14:21-07:00","id":626871,"title":"","content":"That can certainly happen. I think it is safe to say that we all look forward to seeing what comes next. I hope to finish my own letters fairly soon. I am trying to make sure I understand everything first to avoid crazy mistakes like I made with Lead Foot. lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T06:23:58-07:00","id":629843,"title":"","content":"Hi guys, sorry about the lateness of my letter. Between work being a lot busier than normal and entertaining a friend whose come to visit for a while I haven't had much time to write. Most of my letter was what I wrote during work breaks on the note function of my phone lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T09:36:22-07:00","id":632398,"title":"","content":"Great letters. I will try to get experience up soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-19T11:54:32-07:00","id":632566,"title":"","content":"Good news. I was PMed by Shadowedeyes, who might be interested in joining the game. I played with her in theses games before, and she did a great job. This should be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T17:42:40-07:00","id":634048,"title":"","content":"Finally posted my letter. Featuring Division 9 from Skin and Bones. Also featuring Yosef's aproar at Cire's carelessness.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-20T21:21:49-07:00","id":634235,"title":"","content":"Love it. Great letter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T23:01:36-07:00","id":639886,"title":"","content":"Hello everyone. As Cire mentioned previously, I'll be joining the game soon. I've played with Cire in the past, which has always been fun, and having read through the current game I'm sure it'll be great. I know there is a turn order, so I won't post anything on the other thread until that's been sorted out, but I just wanted to say hey to everyone first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/470-shadowedeyes","name":"Shadowedeyes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-26T07:47:00-07:00","id":640188,"title":"","content":"Welcome! It will be great to play with you again. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T14:44:46-07:00","id":642098,"title":"","content":"Hi guys, sorry for not being around I've been keeping busy with my last week of work and other things. I'll start my letter now, and should have something posted tomorrow afternoon if that's alright with everyone.<br /> <br /> And hey Shadowedeyes, welcome to the game <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> At the moment the turn order is something like Daimon -&gt; Myself -&gt; Cod of Justice, with Cire posting when he can. I don't mind when you want to join in the turn, as long as everyone's alright with it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T15:20:26-07:00","id":642142,"title":"","content":"I'm alright with any given turn order, but I doubt that this system will work at all with 4 or more players. 7/4=1,75 which leaves everybody with one to two days to post every week.<br /> <br /> For example, I usually write my letters in evening and/or early night. But not all of my evenings are free time and rather often I can't afford going to bed too late. So its possible that relatively often I won't be able to write my letter in a 2-day window. And I doubt that only I will have those problems.<br /> <br /> I propose using a more flexible system. For example, every week my turn will be before Cod's; and warrior angel's turn will be before Shadowedeyes'. Cire and irregular players (Exthalion) will post whenever they can. This system allows such orders as Daimon (D) -&gt; Cod (C) -&gt; warrior angel (W) -&gt; Shadowedeyes (S), W-&gt;D-&gt;S-&gt;C, W-&gt;D-&gt;S-&gt;C and many others, effectively doubling time to prepare letters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T18:21:43-07:00","id":642284,"title":"","content":"That makes sense, Daimon. Also Warrior Angel, I totally understand. Once more, pretty much everyone quit at my work again. lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T19:40:26-07:00","id":642390,"title":"","content":"I'm good with whatever. I'll go with me after Warrior Angel unless a post says differently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/470-shadowedeyes","name":"Shadowedeyes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T00:53:56-07:00","id":642714,"title":"","content":"Sounds fine to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T09:55:13-07:00","id":643125,"title":"","content":"Hiya all, just posted my letter up now. Had a bit of writer's block of all things lol, but cobbled something together. You'll have to excuse my blonde moment (so to speak), but could someone make it a bit clearer on what's happening with the turn phase?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-28T13:40:12-07:00","id":643326,"title":"","content":"I'm not going to be able to get my letter up until Sunday, so anyone that feels like posting go ahead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4926-cod-of-justice","name":"Cod of Justice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4926_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-29T21:28:37-07:00","id":644912,"title":"","content":"I just posted up my first letter, since I believe with Daimon's suggestion of turn order I was good to go after Warrior Angel. If I messed something up, feel free to assume your character didn't receive the letter until after this week's was sent out. (Actually, feel free to do so regardless if it helps)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/470-shadowedeyes","name":"Shadowedeyes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-31T09:27:26-07:00","id":646875,"title":"","content":"First, at long last, experience. Since I last gave experience, Warrior Angel wrote four great letters. Therefore, he has earned 16 regular experience, and 8 arcane experience. Cod of Justice has written five great letters, and earns 20 regular experience, and 10 arcane experience. Daimon has written four great letter and earns 16 experience and 8 arcane experience. Our newest player Shadowedeyes has written a great letter, and thus earns 4 regular experience, and 2 arcane experience. Thank you all.<br /> <br /> As to turn order, in past games, there were not turns per say. What we had then were weeks that started on Tuesdays. However, that was not a perfect system either as letters can understandably be late. Honestly, I am not totally sure what should be done. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T04:40:10-07:00","id":649943,"title":"","content":"I've got my letter ready if everyone's alright with me posting it next.<br /> <br /> As for turn order, it does seem a difficult thing to try and arrange. As someone who has posted late on occasion and even missed a week here and there, I can't say much about keeping to a schedule. Daimon's idea of having it so we are paired off and prepare our letter once our partner has posted theirs could work, as it gives us all roughly 3 days to work on it and it doesn't take much to add a new paragraph addressing the events in someone else's letter or quickly changing something.<br /> <br /> As for experience, I'll have to start deciding what to spend it on! I also have plans for Phoenix to join the Tamers of Fire legacy in the near future so I'm going to have to sort something out for him in the near future.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T09:11:38-07:00","id":650193,"title":"","content":"I look forward to seeing your letter. Daimon's idea may be the way to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-09T15:15:51-07:00","id":658441,"title":"","content":"Hiya guys, just wanted to see if everyone was okay. Was quite surprised to see that no one's posted for a while...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4910-warrior-angel","name":"warrior angel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4910_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-09T15:36:52-07:00","id":658505,"title":"","content":"I'm a teacher and the beginning of academic year is killing me. %) Maybe I'll have time to post tomorrow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/120-daimon","name":"Daimon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedb